Z||000016||gt boy||08-22-2001||12:09 AM||||ski...that one pic in front of the building is now my wallpaper....my wife just loves your car.<P>i don't want to be a copy cat ...but...what color red paint is that and where did you get that lower front air dam from...with the lights of course...real sweet!<p>[This message has been edited by gt boy (edited 08-22-2001).]||||reg||14
Z||000017||skitime||08-22-2001||12:17 AM||||    <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by gt boy:<BR><B>ski...that one pic in front of the barn is now my wallpaper....my wife just loves your car.<P>i don't want to be a copy cat ...but...what color red paint is that and where did you get that lower front air dam from...with the lights of course...real sweet!</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>haha Copy cat! This is one of the most common Fiero colors. Believe it or not it is the original factory color.   Most darken with age so it looks different. This was mixed from the code on the front fender.  <P>I made the front air dam myself too.  It is made of urethane like the fenders not fiberglass that breaks as soon as you bump it.  <P>I just email you a high resolution copy of that pic. Enjoy<P><p>[This message has been edited by skitime (edited 08-22-2001).]||||reg||1
